# DRF
# django-rest-swagger 2.2.0 (unmaintained since 2019) imports CoreJSONRenderer, which DRF
# dropped in 3.16 along with the rest of its coreapi support. Held back until the API docs
# view in akvo/urls.py moves to a maintained generator such as drf-spectacular.
djangorestframework<3.16
